{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/mw7HlAJHhfje-B4nH3IYwg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:46.965197+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/mw7HlAJHhfje-B4nH3IYwg","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/w8KncBktzW1AEibRZlrvLLnB1ATfiaialibfngt3GoyKRz03qE8iajibPXdT9NalzLhXv7mNBRnsfibLuVIUCDr4J0L5O53rznbziazEjayVsTDDTiaE/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>生物科学与技术学院欢迎优秀应届本科毕业生申请攻读我院推荐免试研究生(全日制硕士研究生)，</span><strong><span>申请条件见《北京林业大学2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生实施办法》</span></strong><span>。为规范推免生招生工作，按照教育部及学校相关文件精神，特制定本方案。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、接收推免生的学科专业</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>硕士研究生招生专业目录</span></strong><span>中的学科专业均可接收推免生，各学科接收</span><strong><span>推免生计划数以推免系统</span></strong><span>中发布为准。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、申请程序</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>所有考生必须登录</span><strong><span>北京林业大学预推免系统</span></strong><span>注册、填报信息、上传资格审核材料，仅注册未提交的考生视为未报名。我院各学科推免预报名</span><strong><span>截止时间：9月14日14:00</span></strong><span>。系统网址：</span><span><span>http://tm.yzb.bjfu.edu.cn/</span></span><span>，报名提交后考生需</span><strong><span>及时关注系统通知</span></strong><span>，接到复试通知后尽快确认是否同意参加复试。如同意参加复试，请</span><strong><span>按各招生学科要求</span></strong><span>准备并按时参加学科组织的复试。</span></p><p><span>国家研招网“推免服务系统”开放后，所有参加复试的考生</span><strong><span>务必在国家研招网推免服务系统中正式报名</span></strong><span>。学院将通过国家研招网推免招生系统向考生</span><strong><span>再次发送</span></strong><span>复试通知及拟录取通知，收到通知的考生</span><strong><span>需在设定时间内回复</span></strong><span>，以免影响拟录取进程。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、复试资格审核</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>考生需在北京林业大学预推免系统中提交以下材料的扫描件，复试时查验原件：</span></strong></p><p><span>1.</span><strong><span> 第二代身份证</span></strong><span>（正反面在一页纸上）、</span><strong><span>学生证</span></strong><span>（照片页及注册页）</span></p><p><span>2. 加盖本科在读学校教务部门公章的</span><strong><span>成绩单</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>3. 国家英语四六级、TOEFL或GRE成绩单等可</span><strong><span>体现考生英语水平</span></strong><span>的证明材料。</span></p><p><span>4. 证明申请人</span><strong><span>学术水平和业务能力</span></strong><span>的学术论文或获奖证书等材料。</span></p><p><span>5. </span><strong><span>100元复试费缴费证明</span></strong><span>。通过资格审查获得面试资格的考生自行在我校预推免系统中扫码缴纳复试费，操作指南见附件。缴费凭证截图尽快发送至邮箱：</span><span><span>yangdi@bjfu.edu.cn</span></span><span> ,邮箱命名格式：“</span><strong><span>复试学科专业名+姓名+复试费缴费凭证</span></strong><span>”。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、学科复试办法及安排</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>各学科及招生方向复试办法见附件，</span></p><p><strong><span>复试安排如下表</span></strong><span>：</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w8KncBktzW0kQZXSNz2Y3VNkxOvEVLfPvIWfzgcEc6L1LgPx3W17l1omNmPp99KF8xAgMia7wIPBiaT5coGVEn2ia7dAxia2AQiaKoI15c8FuXdI/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、体检</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>被</span><strong><span>拟录取</span></strong><span>的考生需进行体检，体检标准同</span><strong><span>《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》</span></strong><span>。考生可自行选择</span><strong><span>二级甲等（含）以上医院</span></strong><span>进行体检，体检表电子版打包发送至邮箱：</span><span><span>yangdi@bjfu.edu.cn </span></span><span>，</span><strong><span>截止日期：10月20日</span></strong><span>。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、录取</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>各学科按照招生计划，根据推免生复试</span><strong><span>总成绩排名</span></strong><span>确定拟录取名单，最终录取名单以教育部审核通过为准。</span><strong><span>有以下情况之一的不予录取</span></strong><span>：</span></p><p><span>①复试总成绩不及格。</span></p><p><span>②体检不合格。</span></p><p><span>③无导师接收。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>七、其他</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>本文件未提及事宜，参照</span><strong><span>《北京林业大学2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生实施办法》</span></strong><span>执行。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>附件</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/mw7HlAJHhfje-B4nH3IYwg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">各学科复试办法.zip</a></span></p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/mw7HlAJHhfje-B4nH3IYwg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">体检表.doc</a></span><span><br/></span></section><section><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/mw7HlAJHhfje-B4nH3IYwg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">用户缴费流程及操作手册.docx</a></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/MVPvEL7Qg0FbjHxtEaelWVcdiclxfBsSKzpNzybABXC4ia4LmSyNwLeFXAuDmAqGibuWgiaF43xFQ9ic1F8o9Ria4Igw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>往期精选</span></strong></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MDU4ODc1Ng==&amp;mid=2651745485&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=52c4e4ac46656e8bee3dc0315e95bd3f&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/7qiaqX10xQ0ZicCBW2EiaEH224pL3oL5mICw35BNdg2rxAnCYCicWo7l6t46icjvfsic5gE9wACHmUmx9JVQFgmjzbow/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MDU4ODc1Ng==&amp;mid=2651744481&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=3ff449967a55dfe2567d972c51e1df09&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/7qiaqX10xQ0ZicCBW2EiaEH224pL3oL5mICGZnUC3yg8kr9R6oa8tHSzYxr0Dw2tHLm2cceGInbh